    "text": "2 hours ago City of Texas City The Gulf Coast Transit District started the holiday season with a splash by announcing their new service that connects the mainland to Galveston.The service is called The Splash, and it launched this week. It runs from 6 a.m. to 8 p.m., Monday through Saturday, taking riders from the Gulf Coast Transit District terminal in Texas City (1415 33rd Street N) to 2418 Strand Street in Galveston.One-way fare is $1 for general riders, or $0.50 for seniors (65+), individual [...] Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
